WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.440
Hey, so I have a bunch of photos to show you.

00:02.440 --> 00:04.440
First, I walked around the perimeter.

00:04.440 --> 00:06.940
While this damage functionally isn't a big deal,

00:06.940 --> 00:09.000
it really helps build a story.

00:09.000 --> 00:10.300
Think of us like lawyers,

00:10.300 --> 00:12.780
and this collateral damage is the evidence

00:12.780 --> 00:13.920
that builds the case,

00:13.920 --> 00:16.320
which helps us get the roof and siding approved.

